    "● Ultimate Audiophile & Master Collection: If you have high-end wired equipment and don't mind storage space, DSF (DSD) and WAV are the best choices for master-grade lossless audio, typically requiring expensive Hi-Fi headphones or speakers to reach their full potential." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
